# Hosted Table (local pass-and-play): two captains signal ready, each deploys
# behind the "Pass the chart" card, and the first captain takes the first shot
# by the cursor; then the pause card leaves the match.
until 600 FLEET SIGNALS
frames 30
click =Hosted Table
until 120 Local pass-and-play
frames 10
click =Not ready
frames 10
click =Not ready
frames 10
save hosted-lobby
click =Start match
until 300 Deploy your fleet
frames 20
key KeyA 1
frames 10
click =Confirm deployment
until 120 Pass the chart
frames 10
save hosted-handover
click I am Captain 2
frames 30
key KeyA 1
frames 10
click =Confirm deployment
until 300 Pass the chart
frames 10
click I am Captain 1
until 600 Your turn
frames 70
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
until 300 Pass the chart
frames 10
save hosted-pass
click I am Captain 2
until 300 Your turn
frames 30
key Escape 1
until 60 Paused
frames 10
click =Leave match
until 300 FLEET SIGNALS
